@startuml
title Book room (revised)

|Student|
start
:Choose room, start time and end time;
:Submit booking request;

|Smart Campus|
if (Start in future and 0 < duration <= 2 h? (R1)) then ([no])
  :Reject booking - invalid time range (R1);
  stop
else ([yes])
endif

if (Room blocked? (R3)) then ([yes])
  :Reject booking - room is blocked (R3);
  stop
else ([no])
endif

if (Overlaps an ACTIVE booking of the same room? (R2)) then ([yes])
  :Reject booking - time slot is taken (R2);
  note right
    Time is [start, end):
    a booking that ends at 12:00 and one
    that starts at 12:00 do not overlap (A1).
  end note
  stop
else ([no])
endif

:Create booking with status ACTIVE;
:Issue confirmation to the student (R4);
stop
@enduml
